# design-system Rules For Cursor

Thin adapter: read `AGENTS.md` in this repo and the shared contract at
`~/Projects/command-center/tooling/agent-operating-contract.md` rather than inventing
tool-specific behaviour.

Key points:

- Bootstrap first on fresh clones: `npm run bootstrap`.
- Gate before commit: `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, `npm run build`,
  `npm run check:css`.
- Public API is the `src/index.ts` barrel; React stays a peer dependency.
- Publishing/releases are Robin-gated — ask first.
